  "title": "Jon McNeill: How Elon Musk Makes Decisions",
  "summary": "Jon McNeill is the former President of Tesla and the co-founder and CEO of DVx Ventures. Elon Musk believes speed creates a competitive advantage, whether it’s speed of decision, speed of cash, or speed of response. But what does that look like day to day, and how do you build a company around it? Jon … The post Jon McNeill: How Elon Musk Makes Decisions ap…",
  "content": "<p>Jon McNeill is the former President of Tesla and the co-founder and CEO of DVx Ventures.</p>\n\n\n\n<div>\n            <div>\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                                            <div>\n                            <div></div>\n                        </div>\n                                        \n                </div>\n                <div></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    \n            \n        <div>\n        <h3>Featured clips</h3>\n        <div>\n                                            <div>\n                    <div>\n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-10-at-06.24.19-300x169.png\" alt=\"How to Impress Elon Musk\">                                                                            <div>\n                                \n                                00:57                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>How to Impress Elon Musk</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div>\n                    <div>\n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-10-at-06.17.34-300x169.png\" alt=\"Building Tesla’s Culture of Speed\">                                                                            <div>\n                                \n                                08:49                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>Building Tesla’s Culture of Speed</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div>\n                    <div>\n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-10-at-06.23.53-300x169.png\" alt=\"Motivating Sellers Without Commissions\">                                                                            <div>\n                                \n                                14:46                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>Motivating Sellers Without Commissions</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div>\n                    <div>\n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-10-at-06.24.54-300x169.png\" alt=\"A Cheat Sheet for Better Decision-Making\">                                                                            <div>\n                                \n                                23:37                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>A Cheat Sheet for Better Decision-Making</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div>\n                    <div>\n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-10-at-06.24.06-300x169.png\" alt=\"How Elon Started Every Product Meeting\">                                                                            <div>\n                                \n                                30:44                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>How Elon Started Every Product Meeting</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div>\n                    <div>\n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-10-at-06.24.36-300x169.png\" alt=\"Why Steve Jobs Blew Off Elon\">                                                                            <div>\n                                \n                                43:16                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>Why Steve Jobs Blew Off Elon</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div>\n                    <div>\n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"170\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-10-at-06.18.18-300x170.png\" alt=\"How a Hot Wheels Car Solved an Engineering Problem\">                                                                            <div>\n                                \n                                52:45                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>How a Hot Wheels Car Solved an Engineering Problem</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div>\n                    <div>\n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-10-at-06.16.51-300x169.png\" alt=\"The Reason for Leaving Tesla\">                                                                            <div>\n                                \n                                1:07:10                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>The Reason for Leaving Tesla</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div>\n                    <div>\n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-10-at-06.17.59-300x169.png\" alt=\"How to Identify World Class Talent in Interviews\">                                                                            <div>\n                                \n                                1:16:33                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>How to Identify World Class Talent in Interviews</p>\n                                    </div>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n<p>Elon Musk believes speed creates a competitive advantage, whether it’s speed of decision, speed of cash, or speed of response. But what does that look like day to day, and how do you build a company around it?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Jon spent years inside Elon’s companies, and he explains how they work. We talk about what happens when you skip the chain of command, why bad news can’t wait, and why Elon wanted problems explained in three sentences.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We also get into the five-step algorithm Jon uses to simplify problems, why Elon treats a company like a garden full of weeds, and how Tesla grew with zero marketing budget.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Available Now: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/pRXMqm5bMFk?si=W6Ds8u2zRdPQiUSu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube</a> | <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/0EGGFv66qMHlnVSbKVaZUL?si=97a9f4c1d2ee49cb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Spotify</a></strong></strong> <strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/ca/podcast/how-elon-musk-solves-problems-jon-mcneill/id990149481?i=1000800980859\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apple Podcasts</a> | <a href=\"https://x.com/shaneparrish/status/2120504470828200315?a=I4-e5yoSOCPvQj457IA&amp;s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">X</a> | <a href=\"https://fs.blog/knowledge-project-podcast-transcripts/jon-mcneill/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Transcript</a></strong></p>\n\n\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://fs.blog/knowledge-project-podcast/jon-mcneill/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jon McNeill: How Elon Musk Makes Decisions</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://fs.blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Farnam Street</a>.</p>",
